<Textbox Name="P3_DocsWajib">
  <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
  <CanShrink>false</CanShrink>
  <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
  <Paragraphs><Paragraph><Style><SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>Dokumen Pengajuan Klaim Wajib</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>a.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Asli formulir klaim rawat inap yang telah diisi dengan jujur, benar dan lengkap dan telah ditandatangani oleh Anda atau Penerima Manfaat;</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>b.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Asli Surat Keterangan Dokter klaim rawat inap (Bagian 2 formulir klaim);</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>c.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Fotokopi identitas Anda, Tertanggung dan/atau Penerima Manfaat yang masih berlaku;</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>d.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Fotokopi semua hasil Pemeriksaan Medis (termasuk namun tidak terbatas laboratorium, radiologi, obat);</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>e.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Asli atau fotokopi legalisir semua kuitansi dan rincian tagihan biaya Rumah Sakit;</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>f.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Fotokopi halaman depan Tabungan yang mencantumkan nomor rekening Anda atau Penerima Manfaat; dan</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.42cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.42cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>2.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>9.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>g.	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Dokumen-dokumen lainnya sehubungan dengan pengajuan klaim (jika dibutuhkan oleh Kami).</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph></Paragraphs>
