10 hari.
Maka Kami akan membayarkan Manfaat Asuransi kepada Bapak Rony berupa:</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.28cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.28cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>1.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.2pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>•	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Santunan Rawat Inap akibat Kecelakaan Rp10.000.000,-</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.28cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.28cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>1pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.2pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>•	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Santunan Cepat Sembuh Rp1.500.000,-</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph></Paragraphs>
  <Top>6.58cm</Top>
  <Left>0.96cm</Left>
