  </Style>
</Textbox>
<Textbox Name="P4_Klaim3">
  <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
  <CanShrink>false</CanShrink>
  <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
  <Paragraphs><Paragraph><Style><TextAlign>Center</TextAlign><SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>(Klaim 3)</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.5pt</FontSize><FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><SpaceAfter>2pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.5pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>Pada tanggal 2 Januari 2017, Bapak Rony mengalami sakit hernia dan di Rawat Inap di Rumah Sakit selama 8 hari dan menjalani pembedahan.
Maka Kami akan membayarkan Manfaat Asuransi kepada Bapak Rony berupa:</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.28cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.28cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>1.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.2pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>•	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Santunan Rawat Inap akibat Penyakit Rp4.000.000,-</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.28cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.28cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>1.5pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.2pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>•	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Santunan Tindakan Bedah Rp5.000.000,-</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph><Paragraph><Style><LeftIndent>0.28cm</LeftIndent><HangingIndent>-0.28cm</HangingIndent><SpaceAfter>1pt</SpaceAfter><LineHeight>8.2pt</LineHeight></Style><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>•	</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>#2C2E35</Color></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>Santunan Cepat Sembuh Rp1.500.000,-</Value><Style><FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily><FontSize>6.2pt</FontSize><Color>#004FB6</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns></Paragraph></Paragraphs>
